  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"float:right;max-width: 35%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><b>Cost</b></td>\n<td>$5,650, 6,000x <a href=\"/index.php/Rubber\" title=\"Rubber\">rubber</a>,<br /> 200x <a href=\"/index.php/Steel\" title=\"Steel\">steel</a>, 5,000x <a href=\"/index.php/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">wood</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Total Cost</b></td>\n<td>$50,000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Inputs</b></td>\n<td>20x <a href=\"/index.php/Crude_oil\" title=\"Crude oil\">crude oil</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Outputs</b></td>\n<td>200x <a href=\"/index.php/Plastic\" title=\"Plastic\">plastic</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Production interval</b></td>\n<td>25 seconds\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Production/Min</b></td>\n<td>480x <a href=\"/index.php/Plastic\" title=\"Plastic\">plastic</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Production/Hour</b></td>\n<td>28,800x <a href=\"/index.php/Plastic\" title=\"Plastic\">plastic</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Profit/Sec</b></td>\n<td>$4.00\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Profit/Min</b></td>\n<td>$240.00\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Profit/Hour</b></td>\n<td>$14,400.00\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Return On Investment/Min</b></td>\n<td>0.47%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Time to ROI</b></td>\n<td>212,59 Minutes<br />(~4 Hours)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Aliases</b></td>\n<td>plastic factory, plasticfactory,<br /> plastic fac\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The plastic factory is a facility that produces 200x <a href=\"/index.php/Plastic\" title=\"Plastic\">plastic</a> every 25 seconds. It needs to be supported by 4/5 of an <a href=\"/index.php/Oil_well\" title=\"Oil well\">Oil well</a> to function.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_facilities\">Related facilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Plastic_factory&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Related facilities\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\"